Two dogs play in the grass.

It is September a little later.

Still blue and shimmering with autumn leaves;

praying for warm weather.


Pam belly waxes, fur inside out - it is getting colder;


Dave finishes dinner, reins and treats stacked neatly ready;

 to ride home again soon!
